            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un'istanza della classe <code>Virtual_Pet</code> e memorizzala in una variabile chiamata <code>cat</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Virtual_Pet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Whiskers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cat = Virtual_Pet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>cat</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e poi <code>Virtual_Pet</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
